      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_five_regional_mountain_range",
        "path_restriction"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan flees into the Five Regional Mountain Range as his own gambit; his pursuer Qi Zai is the one who recognizes it, realizing too late that this was Fang Yuan’s plan all along.",
      "chapters": [
        1042
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "escape-and-free-passage",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_qi_zai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The range imitates the regional walls. After Fang Yuan enters and can move freely, he guesses that free travel there may also mean free passage through the regional walls.",
